# Prettier resolves ignore files relative to the CWD, and this package's `format:check` is
# `prettier --check .` run from the package directory — so Prettier reads THIS file, never the repo root's.
# Anything generated here has to be listed here as well; a path declared only at the root is invisible to
# this check, and `format:check` then fails on a file nobody wrote.
node_modules
dist
cdk.out
cdk.context.json
*.tsbuildinfo

# k6 load-test CREDENTIAL MATERIAL — generated per run by `tests/load/prepare-clerk-tokens.ts`, and
# gitignored at the repo root for the reason spelled out there: it is a pool of ~6,000 live Clerk bearer
# tokens (4.2 MB) and THIS REPO IS PUBLIC. Formatting a generated blob that large is pointless, and failing
# the build on it is worse — the run that mints the pool would red every unrelated check in the package.
tests/load/clerk-tokens.json
tests/load/clerk-public-key.pem
